{"ID":"20240205153737-3k2zgdj","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240205153737-3k2zgdj","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153737-3k2zgdj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153737-2ex92k3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613131736-5gat4l9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:4400,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240702115636-zer0wkz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"317楝实（川楝子、金玲子、苦楝子）","type":"doc","updated":"20240902161403"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240205153737-2ex92k3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205153737-2ex92k3","updated":"20240206094922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产四川、甘肃、湖北、贵州和云南等地。\n【性状】\t果实类球形，直径2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3cm。表面金黄色至棕黄色，微有光泽，具深棕色小点。顶端有花柱残基，基部凹陷有果梗痕。外果皮革质，与果肉间常成空隙，果肉松软，淡黄色，遇水润湿显粘性。果核球形或卵圆形，质坚硬，两端平截，有6"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8条纵棱，内分6"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8室，每室含黑棕色长圆形的种子1粒。气特异，味酸、苦。\n【性味】\t苦，寒，有小毒。\n【功效】\t舒肝行气止痛，驱虫。用于胸胁、脘腹胀痛，疝痛，虫积腹痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240206094914-ebemjp8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206094914-ebemjp8","updated":"20240206094914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206094914-jfnjt0o.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205162001-rmvooxq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205162001-rmvooxq","updated":"20240205162001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"川楝子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/川楝子-20240205162001-12a7y1d.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240826145600-f7cr7ae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240826145600-f7cr7ae","updated":"20240826145648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 378px;","style":"width: 368px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"楝实"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/楝实-20240826145600-rqhxv87.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 368px;\" parent-style=\"width: 378px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 460px;","style":"width: 450px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"楝实 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/楝实 1-20240826145648-ri4p3zw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 450px;\" parent-style=\"width: 460px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240826145918-v9x8mab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240826145918-v9x8mab","updated":"20240826150613"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 229px;","style":"width: 219px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"楝实12"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/楝实12-20